# Title: Script Interpreter Execution From Suspicious Folder
# ID: 1228c958-e64e-4e71-92ad-7d429f4138ba
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems), Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-02-08
# Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1059
# Description: Detects suspicious script execution from suspicious directories or folders accessible by environment variables that may indicate malware activity.
# Script interpreters (cscript, wscript, mshta, powershell) executing from folders like Temp, Public, or user profile directories may suggest attempts to evade detection or execute malicious scripts.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((((process.command_line:* -ep bypass * OR process.command_line:* -ExecutionPolicy bypass * OR process.command_line:* -w hidden * OR process.command_line:*/e:javascript * OR process.command_line:*/e:Jscript * OR process.command_line:*/e:vbscript *)) OR ((process.executable:*\\cscript.exe OR process.executable:*\\mshta.exe OR process.executable:*\\wscript.exe)) OR ((process.pe.original_file_name:"cscript.exe" OR process.pe.original_file_name:"mshta.exe" OR process.pe.original_file_name:"wscript.exe"))) AND (((process.command_line:*:\\Perflogs\\* OR process.command_line:*:\\Users\\Public\\* OR process.command_line:*\\%Public%* OR process.command_line:*\\AppData\\Local\\Temp* OR process.command_line:*\\AppData\\Roaming\\Temp* OR process.command_line:*\\Temporary Internet* OR process.command_line:*\\Windows\\Temp* OR process.command_line:*\\Start Menu\\Programs\\Startup\\* OR process.command_line:*%TEMP%* OR process.command_line:*%TMP%* OR process.command_line:*%LocalAppData%\\Temp*)) OR (((process.command_line:*:\\Users\\* AND process.command_line:*\\Favorites\\*)) OR ((process.command_line:*:\\Users\\* AND process.command_line:*\\Favourites\\*)) OR ((process.command_line:*:\\Users\\* AND process.command_line:*\\Contacts\\*)) OR ((process.command_line:*:\\Users\\* AND process.command_line:*\\Documents\\*)) OR ((process.command_line:*:\\Users\\* AND process.command_line:*\\Music\\*)) OR ((process.command_line:*:\\Users\\* AND process.command_line:*\\Pictures\\*)) OR ((process.command_line:*:\\Users\\* AND process.command_line:*\\Videos\\*)))) AND NOT (((process.parent.executable:"C:\\Windows\\System32\\Msiexec.exe" OR process.parent.executable:"C:\\Windows\\SysWOW64\\Msiexec.exe") AND process.executable:*\\powershell.exe AND (process.command_line:*-NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -Command* AND process.command_line:*AppData\\Local\\Temp\\* AND process.command_line:*Install-Chocolatey.ps1*))))
